      "message": "If you allow me to draw parallels with Blaze: we had a similar kind of setup for refactoring common code from test setups (we called them \"Apparatus\"), but it ended up being not very useful and nowadays we just use well-known methods that setUp functions call and that sometimes call each other, for example to add C++ / Java support to our test source tree.",
